This task is on the Spike route. The pre-tool hook reads this marker and
suspends the TDD red-before-green strategy (S2) — code edits are not blocked,
because exploration code is throwaway and red-before-green is the wrong
discipline for it.

Written by the Needle at Frame. Removed only if the spike is re-framed onto a
delivery route (graduation), where the marker no longer applies and the
guardrails apply in full.
